                                "sense_id": "781a4a95-cd39-3df9-8e19-5295d55505e6",
                                "text": "The kindes of Cyphars, (beſides the Simple Cyphars with Changes, and the intermixtures of Nvlles, and Nonsignificants) are many, according to the Nature or Rule of infoulding : Wheele-Cyphars, Kay-Cyphars, Dovbles, &c."
